  "articleBody": "Starting a tiny home project can feel like a lot to juggle, right? There are so many choices, from design to where it will even sit. But don't worry, it's totally manageable once you break it down. We're here to help you get from that exciting idea to a real, livable space that truly fits you.\n\nFirst off, think about how you genuinely live. Zen Tiny Homes specializes in designing around your daily routines – how you cook, sleep, work, and relax. It's not just a smaller version of a big house; it’s a smart space built for your lifestyle.\n\nNext, consider your property. Do you have a spot for it? Is it on a foundation or on wheels? These early questions are super important because they influence everything from design to legal classifications. Zen Tiny Homes has tons of experience navigating these exact issues in San Diego and Southern California.\n\nThen comes the fun part: design. Our 3D Design Program helps you visualize floor plans, architectural details, and makes sure everything meets code. This step makes sure your vision truly comes to life.\n\nFinally, know when to bring in the pros. We've spent over a decade working with local agencies on tiny home legality. If you're feeling stuck on zoning, permits, or just making sense of it all, that's a great time to reach out. We can help you turn those big decisions into a clear path forward. Ready to simplify your living?",
  "datePublished": "2026-09-03"
